hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"366","We are Bishr bin Hilal, we are Abdul-Warith, meaning Ibn Saeed, on the authority of Ayoub. H and Bandar told us, Abdul Wahhab told us, Abu Ayyub told us. Bandar told us, Abdul Wahhab told us, Khaled told us on the authority of Muhammad, unexplained. H. Abu Al-Khattab told us, we are Bishr, meaning Ibn al-Mufaddal, we are Khaled. H. Ziyad bin Ayyub, narrated to us by Hisham, narrated to us on the authority of Khalid. H. Muslim bin Junada narrated to us, on the authority of Waki’, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Khalid al-Hadha’, both of them, on the authority of Abu Qilaba, on the authority of Anas, who said: “He was commanded Bilal intercedes the call to prayer and makes the Iqamat Witr.”"
